    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/bb950903a3b93a1850a548e555d739ab.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elflock, you take on the role of a young princess who must overcome serious challenges after a foreign empire threatens her homeland with war. Gameplay blends classic puzzle-solving with branching dialogues that significantly shape the story, similar to those in popular role-playing games.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FATE OF AN ENTIRE KINGDOM IN YOUR HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When a hostile empire delivers an ultimatum, help your father, the king, make the decision that could save your homeland - or cause its destruction if the circumstances are misjudged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNRAVEL A TANGLED WEB OF ULTERIOR MOTIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You must explore every nook and cranny of the castle and delve into the personal relationships of its residents to gather crucial information about complex characters needed to win the nobles' support for your goals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>EXPLORE YOUR LEGACY:</strong> Rediscover the castle, where you once spent your childhood, now returning as a young adult from your studies abroad. Meet the inhabitants who remember you as a child, and now must address you as their princess and future ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>LEVERAGE YOUR INFLUENCE:</strong> Build meaningful relationships with the people of the castle and read between the lines if necessary. During extensive dialogues, your choices can affect not only the life of the residents, but the fate of the entire kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>USE YOUR WITS:</strong> Investigate, collect evidence, solve puzzles and uncover mysteries in a world full of secrets and underlying meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>AN EYE-CATCHING EXPERIENCE:</strong> Immerse yourself in beautiful modern graphics with fully voiced characters and unique facial motion capture animation for every line spoken!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/bb950903a3b93a1850a548e555d739ab.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elflock, you take on the role of a young princess who must overcome serious challenges after a foreign empire threatens her homeland with war. Gameplay blends classic puzzle-solving with branching dialogues that significantly shape the story, similar to those in popular role-playing games.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FATE OF AN ENTIRE KINGDOM IN YOUR HANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/64f87411d9a3b5985c53e26eba3d3eea.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When a hostile empire delivers an ultimatum, help your father, the king, make the decision that could save your homeland - or cause its destruction if the circumstances are misjudged.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNRAVEL A TANGLED WEB OF ULTERIOR MOTIVES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/2886bfb5bf2fa773c6fb1ddbf70114ed.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You must explore every nook and cranny of the castle and delve into the personal relationships of its residents to gather crucial information about complex characters needed to win the nobles' support for your goals. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff0 <strong>EXPLORE YOUR LEGACY:</strong> Rediscover the castle, where you once spent your childhood, now returning as a young adult from your studies abroad. Meet the inhabitants who remember you as a child, and now must address you as their princess and future ruler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>LEVERAGE YOUR INFLUENCE:</strong> Build meaningful relationships with the people of the castle and read between the lines if necessary. During extensive dialogues, your choices can affect not only the life of the residents, but the fate of the entire kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>USE YOUR WITS:</strong> Investigate, collect evidence, solve puzzles and uncover mysteries in a world full of secrets and underlying meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>AN EYE-CATCHING EXPERIENCE:</strong> Immerse yourself in beautiful modern graphics with fully voiced characters and unique facial motion capture animation for every line spoken!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.poster.avif?t=1752034296\" width=700 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.webm?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094690/extras/cb0c076559589d71be7c24d5b1efed48.mp4?t=1752034296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
